  "goodToKnow": "Die Lichtgeschwindigkeit is the speed of light, almost 300,000 kilometres per second in a vacuum. Albert Einstein, born in Ulm, made it the cosmic speed limit in his special theory of relativity of 1905. Das Lichtjahr (light year) is a distance, not a time. Mit Lichtgeschwindigkeit is used jokingly for very fast. It has no plural."
